# Docusaurus
.docusaurus/
build/
node_modules/

# Pages the build writes under docs/. pull-docs.mjs copies every page the publication manifest
# lists into a folder there, and TypeDoc writes docs/api/. The manifest lives in agentos and adds
# folders without a change here (docs/text/ came with a new section), so everything inside a
# folder under docs/ is ignored, not each folder by name. The files written in this repository
# are excepted below; the guard step in deploy.yml fails a build when one of them is not.
docs/*/**

# The Paracosm reference. The build does not check Paracosm out and serves this committed copy.
!docs/paracosm/**

# Pages written in this repository (the manifest's siteDoc entries).
!docs/architecture/skills-vs-tools-vs-extensions.md
!docs/benchmarks/index.md
!docs/features/citation-verification.md
!docs/features/llm-output-validation.md
!docs/wunderland/index.md

# Internal planning content — never publish (see CLAUDE.md)
.superpowers/
docs/superpowers/
docs/specs/
docs/plans/
docs/internal/
docs/audits/
docs/STEP_*.md
docs/PHASE_*.md
docs/STAGE_*.md
docs/SESSION_*.md
docs/HANDOFF*.md
docs/FINDINGS*.md
docs/*-v[0-9]*-plan*.md
docs/*-v[0-9]*-design*.md
docs/*-plan-phase*.md

# Environment
.env
.env.local

# macOS
.DS_Store
